{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_230_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_230","textTraditional":"一、二年，春，王二月，季孫斯、叔孫州仇、仲孫何忌帥師伐邾，取漷東田及沂西田。癸巳，叔孫州仇、仲孫何忌及邾子盟於句繹。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_230_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_230","textTraditional":"漷東，未盡也。沂西，未盡也。三人伐而二人盟何也？各盟其得也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_230_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_230","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，丙子，衞侯元卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_230_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_230","textTraditional":"三、滕子來朝。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_230_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_230","textTraditional":"四、晉趙鞅帥師納衞世子蒯聵於戚。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_230_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_230","textTraditional":"納者，內弗受也。帥師而後納者，有伐也。何用弗受也？以輙不受也，以輙不受父之命，受之王父也。信父而辭王父，則是不尊王父也。其弗受，以尊王父也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_230_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_230","textTraditional":"五、秋，八月，甲戌，晉趙鞅帥師及鄭罕達戰於鐵。鄭師敗績。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_230_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_230","textTraditional":"六、冬，十月，葬衞靈公。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_230_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_230","textTraditional":"七、十有一月，蔡遷於州來。蔡殺其大夫公子駟。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}